WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.000
ClearPath brings daily recovery residence operations into one operating path.

2
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Records, messages, files, and follow-up all compete for attention.

3
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Residents, staff, beds, safety, documents, finance, outcomes, and owner review stay connected.

4
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:55.000
The dashboard becomes the place to see what needs attention.

5
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Profiles connect status, documents, notes, contacts, milestones, and next steps.

6
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:23.000
Beds, locations, roles, and schedules become part of the same operating rhythm.

7
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:37.000
Medication support and supply requests stay closer to the resident workflow.

8
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:51.000
Hard moments become clearer records, follow-up, and safety review.

9
00:01:51.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Compliance, documents, signatures, and training stay easier to review.

10
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:19.000
Finance, grants, outcomes, and analytics become stronger when the work is already organized.

11
00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:32.000
Pick one operator workflow and validate it with a real day.
